    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase rituko rie ritang’ani ri’omotienyi o gatano na kabere ’namobe nomosangererekano bwatananire ase ogosasiima. Timokora emeremo ya kera rituko. Rituko erio nigo rirabe rituko ri’okobugia ebiroria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Morue eeri ensae eyemo, na emingichi enene eyemo, ne chimingichi chimanwa isano na ibere, echiakoorire omwaka oyomo, chitari na kemocho ase emebere yabo, chibe ekeng’wanso ki’ogosambwa kere ne rimisu rigiya rikogwenera Omonene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amo nekeng’wanso ekio morue okoruegwa kw’endagera, obosie obonuke bwochoganirie n’amaguta: Amo neeri eria morue obosie ebimunu bitano na kemo, na amo nemingichi eria obosie ebimunu bine,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "boigo ase kera eyemo ye chimanwa ye chimingichi chiria isano na ibere, obosie ebimunu bibere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naende morue egoree eyemo ebe ekeng’wanso ki’ebibe ase ogokora okobwatanigwa ase more.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebing’wanso ebio bimentwe ase ekeng’wanso ki’ogosambwa ki’Omotienyi Omoyia, amo n’okoruegwa kw’endagera gochiikire, na ekeng’wanso ki’ogosambwa gia kera rituko na okoruegwa kw’endagera na ogw’ekenyugwa gokorentwa amo nebio, koreng’ana nomoroberio ochiikire. Ebinto ebio bire ne rimisu rigiya, okoruegwa kogosambwa nomorero ase Omonene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ebing’wanso Bie Rituko Ri’okobwatanigwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase rituko ria ikomi ri’omotienyi oyio o gatan’akabere, mobe nomosangererekano bwatananire ase ogosasiima. Mobe mokweng’ata na gweitia. Timokora emeremo ende yonsi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Morue eeri ensae eyemo, na emingichi eyemo, ne chimanwa chimingichi isan’aibere, echiakoorire omwaka oyomo, chionsi chibe chitari na kemocho ase emebere yabo. Echio nchibe ekeng’wanso ki’ogosambwa kere ne rimisu rigiya rikogwenera Omonene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amo nachirochio morue okoruegwa kw’endagera, obosie obonuke bwochoganirie n’amaguta. Amo neeri eria morue obosie ebimunu bitan’akemo, na amo nemingichi eria obosie ebimunu bine,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na amo na kera eyemo ye chimanwa chimingichi, chiria isan’aibere, obosie ebimunu bibere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naende morue egoree eyemo ebe ekeng’wanso ki’ebibe, kementwe ase ekeng’wanso ki’ogokora okobwatanigwa, na ekeng’wanso ki’ogosambwa gwa kera rituko, amo n’okoruegwa kw’endagera na okw’ebinyugwa gochiikire amo nabirobio.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ebing’wanso bi’Amatuko Amanane y’Ebigutu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
